  by an open tool-calling instruct model on the H100 (e.g. Qwen3 8B/14B, Ministral 3 14B, Llama 3.1 8B
  Instruct -- verify tool-calling quality and transformers support when choosing). Keeps the thesis
  premise ("open-source LLMs"), which C does not.
