  generation ~2-5 min per case -> ~6-14 h per rung; use --case-shard to stay inside the 14 h wall.
  ~15-30 GPU-h for C0/C1-style rungs on one model.
  FEASIBILITY: MEDIUM-LOW. The fine-tuned adapters were trained to emit one JSON object and cannot
  hold a tool trajectory (see G2 note above), so this runs on BASE instruct models -- it measures
  "agentic open model" against "fine-tuned one-shot open model", not the effect of tools on the
  fine-tuned model. Small models are weak at multi-step tool use; report the tool-call error rate
  (malformed calls, loops, budget exhaustion) as a first-class result, before any F1.

- COULD (E, 2026-09-15) REASONING LLMs, FINE-TUNED, THROUGH THE SAME PIPELINE AS THE FOUR NON-REASONING
  MODELS (llama31-8b, ministral3-14b, ministral3-3b, gemma3-4b). Extends the notes/TODO.md Q10
